    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d164">

                <pb facs="0330" n="300" xml:id="pg300"/>

                <head>164. Telegram From the CIA
                        Station in [<hi rendition="#italic">place not declassified</hi>] to
                        Operation PBSUCCESS Headquarters in Florida<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d164-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>[<hi rendition="#italic">place not declassified</hi>], <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1954-05-30T18:33:00+00:00">May 30, 1954,
                        1833Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>382. From Cadick.</p>
                <p>Request identities and available info on four persons discussed with [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">name not declassified</hi>] for early eradication.
                    Confirm early date.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d164-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d164-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Central Intelligence Agency, Job 79–01025A, Box 13, Folder 4. Secret;
                    Routine; RYBAT; PBSUCCESS. Repeated to
                    the Director of Central Intelligence.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
